OL,3,GNEWSAAnger as Uber drivers 'invade for
OL,4,Asummer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaxi drivers in Cornwall have raised
OL,7,Fconcerns about Uber drivers "invading"
OL,8,Ffrom other parts of the country,
OL,9,Fclaiming they are breaking licensing
OL,10,Frules during the summer period.
OL,12,FBrett Bennett, owner of KXR Cars in
OL,13,FPerranporth claimed drivers travelled
OL,14,Fto the county, parked on taxi ranks and
OL,15,Fcharged prices "we can't compete with".
OL,17,FCornwall Council said it had "no legal
OL,18,Fpower" to prevent drivers licensed in
OL,19,Fother areas operating in the county.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
