OL,3,GNEWSAAnger as Uber drivers 'invade for
OL,4,Asummer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUber said it had been granted a licence
OL,7,Fto operate in Cornwall in May and
OL,8,Ffollowed the "same high standards and
OL,9,Fregulations as all private hire
OL,10,Foperators".
